          <th data-col="rvol" class="sort-desc col-rvol">{{ t('Volume', '成交量') }}{{ help('Today\'s volume vs a normal day at this exact time. “2.4× normal” means 2.4 times the usual pace. “Holding” = buyers keep closing bars in the upper half on above-normal volume.', '今日成交量与该时段正常水平之比。“2.4×正常”即为通常速度的2.4倍。“持稳”=买盘持续将K线收在上半段且量高于正常。') }}<span class="sort-ic"></span></th>
          <th data-col="tape" class="col-tape hide-narrow">{{ t('Tape', '盘口') }}{{ help('Where price sits vs the session’s average price (VWAP) and whether the options tape is leaning call-heavy or put-heavy. The options lean is approximate (~soft) — a lean, not a confirmation.', '价格相对当日均价（VWAP）的位置，以及期权带偏看涨还是看跌。期权倾向为近似（~软性）——只作倾向，不作确认。') }}</th>
          <th data-col="dealer" class="col-dealer hide-narrow">{{ t('Dealer map', '做市商地图') }}{{ help('From daily options chains: the nearby ceiling/floor levels dealers defend, the day’s expected move, and whether price is being pinned. A levels-and-timing map for stops — never a direction call, and single-name gamma is a near-constant product trait, not a signal.', '来自每日期权链：做市商防守的上方天花板/下方地板价位、当日预期波动幅度、以及价格是否被钉住。仅为止损用的价位与择时地图——非方向判断；单只标的gamma为近乎恒定的产品属性，非信号。') }}</th>
