<!-- ══ Field guide ══ -->
<section class="panel glass">
  <h2 class="sect-h">{{ t('How to read this board', '如何看懂本看板') }}
    <span class="sect-note">{{ t('field guide','实战指南') }}</span>
  </h2>

  <div class="playbook-section open">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('1 · The one job of this board', '1 · 本看板的唯一任务') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">This board watches a fixed list of institutional leaders — the Mag 7, AI infrastructure, AI software and semiconductors, semicap equipment, reshoring, defense and power-grid names. It looks for one specific thing: a leader that sold off, absorbed the selling, and is now being <em>bought back on real volume</em>. For every name it gives you a plain call — buy now, almost ready, in favour, take profits, watch, or stand aside — and the reason behind it. It is not a stock screener for cheap stocks; it is a timing board for continuation entries in names that already have sponsorship.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">本看板跟踪一份固定的机构领涨股名单——Mag 7、AI基础设施、AI软件与半导体、半导体设备、回流制造、国防与电网标的。它只找一件事：某只领涨股经历下跌、消化卖压、如今正被<em>放量重新买入</em>。对每只标的给出一个通俗结论——现在买入、即将就绪、走势占优、获利了结、观望或暂时观望——并附上理由。这不是找廉价股的筛选器，而是为已有机构参与的标的把握延续入场时机的择时看板。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('2 · What each call means', '2 · 每个结论的含义') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <ul class="l-en">
        <li><b>🟢 Buy now</b> — sold off recently, reclaimed above the day’s average price on durable (not one-spike) volume, and it is a clean leader. The continuation setup is live; stop goes below the washout base.</li>
        <li><b>🔵 Almost ready</b> — the base is built but price hasn’t reclaimed yet. Waiting for a push back above the average price on volume.</li>
        <li><b>🏃 In favour</b> — already trending and holding above the average price, but with no fresh washout. Ride an existing position; not a fresh entry.</li>
        <li><b>🟠 Take profits</b> — stretched well above the average price, or jammed into a dealer ceiling / expiry pin. Expect a pullback; don’t chase.</li>
        <li><b>👀 Watch — don’t chase</b> — moving, but without a washout base, or a name with a history of faking breakouts. Wait for structure.</li>
        <li><b>⚪ Stand aside</b> — quiet tape, no setup right now.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="l-zh">
        <li><b>🟢 现在买入</b> —— 近期下跌后，在持续（非单次）放量中收复当日均价，且为干净的领涨股。延续布局已成立；止损设在洗盘底部下方。</li>
        <li><b>🔵 即将就绪</b> —— 底部已成，但价格尚未收复。等待放量重回均价上方。</li>
        <li><b>🏃 走势占优</b> —— 已在趋势中并守住均价上方，但无新的洗盘。适合持有已有仓位，非新入场点。</li>
        <li><b>🟠 获利了结</b> —— 大幅高于均价，或顶到做市商天花板/到期钉价。预期回落，勿追。</li>
        <li><b>👀 观望——勿追</b> —— 有异动，但无洗盘底部，或该标的有假突破前科。等待结构。</li>
        <li><b>⚪ 暂时观望</b> —— 盘口平静，当前无布局。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('3 · The options tape (approximate direction)', '3 · 期权资金带（方向为近似）') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">The options column shows tape activity and how persistently it leans call-heavy or put-heavy. <em>The direction is approximate</em> — it is signed by a tape rule, not by matching each trade to the bid/offer, so read it as a lean, never a confirmation (that is what the <span class="soft-tag">~soft</span> mark means). Unusual-size flags (big blocks, fresh positions, size-vs-open-interest) are exact counts. It is a supporting input, not a trigger on its own.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">期权栏展示资金带的活跃度，以及其偏看涨或看跌的持续程度。<em>方向为近似</em>——它由盘口规则定向，而非将每笔交易与买卖报价匹配，故仅作倾向、绝非确认（这正是 <span class="soft-tag">~软性</span> 标记的含义）。异常规模标记（大单、新建仓、规模对比未平仓量）为精确计数。它是辅助输入，不单独作为触发。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('4 · The dealer map (levels &amp; stops, not direction)', '4 · 做市商地图（价位与止损，非方向）') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">Built from daily options chains, the dealer map shows the nearby levels market-makers tend to defend — a <em>ceiling</em> above and a <em>floor</em> below — the day’s expected move, and whether price is being pinned near a big strike into expiry. Use it for timing and stop placement: a hard ceiling just overhead argues against chasing; a strong floor below is a logical stop reference. It is never a direction call, and for a single stock the long/short-gamma label is a near-constant trait of the product, not a live signal — so it is shown as context only.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">做市商地图由每日期权链构建，展示做市商倾向防守的邻近价位——上方<em>天花板</em>与下方<em>地板</em>——当日预期波动幅度，以及价格是否在到期临近时被钉在某大行权价附近。用于择时与设置止损：头顶紧邻硬天花板则不宜追高；下方有强地板可作止损参考。它绝非方向判断；对单只股票而言，多头/空头gamma标签是产品近乎恒定的属性，而非实时信号——故仅作背景展示。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="foot-note">
    {{ t('Options-tape direction is approximate (~soft — a tape rule, not bid/offer matching). Every call is a deterministic rule with no score and no black box. Reference levels and the dealer map are context for timing and stops, not trade advice.',
         '期权带方向为近似（~软性——盘口规则，非买卖报价匹配）。每个结论均为确定性规则，无评分、无黑箱。参考价位与做市商地图仅为择时与止损背景，不构成交易建议。') }}
  </p>
</section>

<!-- data_base.js sets window.DATA_BASE → routes the live options-flow fetch to the
     public R2 data plane (present on 171 site pages; v1 omitted it, so R2 flow never loaded). -->
<script src="data_base.js"></script>
<!-- Inline JS — data loads, polling, hero/spotlight/board render -->
<script>
(function(){
'use strict';

// ── Config injected from nightly build ────────────────────────────────────
var BASE_DATA = {{ intraday_flow | tojson if intraday_flow else '{}' }};
var RVOL_CONFIRM = BASE_DATA.rvol_confirm || 1.30;
var DUR_MIN = BASE_DATA.durability_min || 0.60;
var WASHOUT_LB = BASE_DATA.washout_lookback || 10;
var leaders = BASE_DATA.leaders || [];
var LEADERS_BY_TK = {};
leaders.forEach(function(l){ LEADERS_BY_TK[l.ticker] = l; });
var REDUCED_MOTION = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

// ── Live state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quoteState = {};   // ticker -> {price, changePct, vol, hi, lo}
var pulseState = {};   // ticker -> {vwap, vol_durability, higher_lows, cum_vol, bars_today, rvol_tod, session_high, session_low}
var flowState = {};    // ticker -> {ncp(~soft net CALL premium), net_all(~soft calls+puts),
                       //            flow_dur, badges[], session_tier, call_share}
var flowAsof = null, flowRTH = false;

// ── View state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var sortCol = 'rvol', sortDir = -1;
var activeBasket = 'all', activeStance = 'all', searchQ = '', groupByStance = true;
var openRows = {};     // ticker -> true when detail expanded

// ── Stance lane metadata (labels localized; keys deterministic) ────────────
var STANCE_META = {
  act:         { dot:'🟢', lane:'lane-act',    en:'Buy now',            zh:'现在买入', order:0 },
  get_ready:   { dot:'🔵', lane:'lane-ready',  en:'Almost ready',       zh:'即将就绪', order:1 },
  in_favour:   { dot:'🏃', lane:'lane-fav',    en:'In favour',          zh:'走势占优', order:2 },
  take_profits:{ dot:'🟠', lane:'lane-profit', en:'Take profits',       zh:'获利了结', order:3 },
  watch:       { dot:'👀', lane:'lane-watch',  en:"Watch — don't chase",zh:'观望——勿追', order:4 },
  stand_aside: { dot:'⚪', lane:'lane-aside',  en:'Stand aside',        zh:'暂时观望', order:5 }
};

// ── URL helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function snapUrl() { return window.LIVE_SNAPSHOT_URL || 'live/quotes.json'; }
function pulseUrl() { return 'live/flow_pulse.json'; }
function r2Url(path) {
  var base = (window.DATA_BASE || '').replace(/\/+$/, '');
  return base ? base + '/' + path : null;
}

// ── DST-correct ET helper ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
function _etMinutes() {
  var fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {timeZone:'America/New_York', hour12:false, hour:'2-digit', minute:'2-digit'});
  var parts = fmt.formatToParts(new Date()), h=0, m=0;
  parts.forEach(function(p){ if (p.type==='hour') h=parseInt(p.value,10); else if (p.type==='minute') m=parseInt(p.value,10); });
  return h*60 + m;
}
function isMarketHours() { var e=_etMinutes(); return e >= (9*60+25) && e <= (16*60+5); }
// session phase: pre | live | post | closed  (weekday check is intentionally omitted —
// off-hours simply renders the nightly skeleton, which is correct on weekends too)
function sessionPhase() {
  var e = _etMinutes();
  if (e >= (9*60+25) && e <= (16*60+5)) return 'live';
  if (e >= (4*60) && e < (9*60+25)) return 'pre';
  if (e > (16*60+5) && e <= (20*60)) return 'post';
  return 'closed';
}

// ── Derived metrics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function computeRvol(leader, quote, pulse) {
  if (pulse && pulse.rvol_tod != null) return pulse.rvol_tod;   // fastpath-precomputed wins
  if (!quote || !quote.vol || !leader.adv20_shares) return null;
  var curve = leader.vol_share_curve;
  if (!curve || !curve.length) return null;
  var etMins = _etMinutes(), elapsed = etMins - (9*60+30);
  if (elapsed < 0) elapsed = 0;
  var frac = Math.min(elapsed / (6.5*60), 1.0);
  var cumIdx = Math.min(Math.floor(frac * curve.length), curve.length - 1);
  var cumShare = curve[cumIdx] || 0;
  if (cumShare <= 0) return null;
  return quote.vol / (leader.adv20_shares * cumShare);
}
function computeRangePos(quote) {
  if (!quote || quote.lo == null || quote.hi == null || quote.price == null) return null;
  var rng = quote.hi - quote.lo;
  return rng > 0 ? (quote.price - quote.lo) / rng : null;
}
function computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse) {
  if (!quote || !quote.price || !pulse || !pulse.vwap) return null;
  return (quote.price - pulse.vwap) / pulse.vwap * 100;
}

// ── Confluence legs (mirror engine/intraday_flow.confluence_legs) ──────────
function computeLegs(leader, quote, pulse, flow) {
  var L1 = null;
  if (leader.bb_lower_reclaim_days != null) L1 = leader.bb_lower_reclaim_days <= WASHOUT_LB;
  else if (leader.drawdown_21d_pct != null && leader.recovery_begun != null) L1 = leader.drawdown_21d_pct <= -0.12 && leader.recovery_begun;
  if (L1 === null) {
    var proxy = false;
    if (leader.entry_signal && leader.entry_signal.status) {
      var st = (leader.entry_signal.status || '').toLowerCase();
      proxy = st.indexOf('washout')>=0 || st.indexOf('reclaim')>=0 || st.indexOf('bounce')>=0 || st.indexOf('buy')>=0;
    }
    if (!proxy && leader.vol_squeeze && leader.vol_squeeze.coiled) proxy = true;
    if (proxy) L1 = true;
  }
  var L2 = false;
  if (quote && quote.price && pulse && pulse.vwap) L2 = quote.price > pulse.vwap && quote.price > (leader.prev_close || 0);
  var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote, pulse);
  var L3 = rvol !== null && rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM;
  var volDur = pulse ? (pulse.vol_durability != null ? pulse.vol_durability : null) : null;
  var L4 = volDur !== null && volDur >= DUR_MIN;
  // Both halves must read the SAME series: flow.ncp is the cumulative net CALL
  // premium and flow_dur scores that same minutes[].ncp series. (It used to AND the
  // sign of day.net_soft — a net TOTAL, ncp+npp — with call-series durability.)
  // No call read for this name → unknown leg, not a ✗.
  var L5 = null;
  if (flow && flow.ncp != null) {
    var ncpPos = flow.ncp > 0;
    var durOk = flow.flow_dur != null ? flow.flow_dur >= DUR_MIN : ncpPos;  // degrade to sign if dur absent
    L5 = ncpPos && durOk;
  }
  var L6 = false;
  if (leader.mtf_upturn_state) {
    var mst = (leader.mtf_upturn_state || '').toUpperCase();
    L6 = mst === 'UPTURN_WATCH' || mst === 'UPTURN_CONFIRMED';
  } else if (leader.mtf_upturn_K != null) L6 = leader.mtf_upturn_K >= 2;
  var L7 = leader.failed_breakout_trap === false ? true : null;
  var legs = [L1, L2, L3, L4, L5, L6, L7];
  return { legs: legs, K: legs.filter(function(v){ return v === true; }).length };
}

// ── Dealer context accessor ────────────────────────────────────────────────
function dealerOf(leader) {
  var oe = leader.options_entry || {};
  return oe.dealer || null;
}

// ── Stance (mirror engine/intraday_flow.stance — deterministic precedence) ─
function computeStance(leader, quote, pulse, flow, conf) {
  var legs = conf.legs;
  var L1=legs[0], L2=legs[1], L3=legs[2], L4=legs[3], L5=legs[4], L6=legs[5], L7=legs[6];
  var squeeze = !!(leader.vol_squeeze && leader.vol_squeeze.coiled);
  var d = dealerOf(leader);
  var livePresent = isMarketHours() || !!(pulse && pulse.bars_today > 0);

  if (!livePresent) {
    if (L1 === true && (L6 === true || squeeze)) return { key:'get_ready', reason_en:'Base in place — waiting for the open.', reason_zh:'底部已成——等待开盘。', muted:true };
    return { key:'stand_aside', reason_en:'Waiting for the open — live tape not flowing yet.', reason_zh:'等待开盘——实时资金带尚未流动。', muted:true };
  }

  var vwapDelta = computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse);
  var priceUp = quote && quote.changePct != null ? quote.changePct > 0 : false;
  var emDaily = d && d.expected_move_daily_pct != null ? d.expected_move_daily_pct : null;

  // derived risk helpers (dealer-derived; None-safe → false)
  var intoCeiling = !!(d && d.call_wall_hard === true && d.call_wall_dist_sigma != null && d.call_wall_dist_sigma <= 0.5);
  var extendedUp = false;
  if (vwapDelta != null && emDaily != null && emDaily > 0 && vwapDelta >= 1.5 * emDaily) extendedUp = true;
  if (intoCeiling && vwapDelta != null && vwapDelta > 0) extendedUp = true;
  var pinWatch = false;
  if (d && d.opex_days != null && d.opex_days <= 5 && d.regime === 'long') {
    var wu = d.call_wall != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.call_wall - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var wd = d.put_wall != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.put_wall - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var mu = d.magnet_up != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.magnet_up - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var md = d.magnet_down != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.magnet_down - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var near = [wu,wd,mu,md].filter(function(x){ return x != null; });
    if (near.length && Math.min.apply(null, near) <= 1.0) pinWatch = true;
  }
  var aboveVwap = vwapDelta != null ? vwapDelta > 0 : (L2 === true);

  // 1 · Take profits — an up-move stretched into resistance / pin
  if (aboveVwap && (extendedUp || pinWatch)) {
    var why = pinWatch ? 'Pinned near a big strike into expiry — expect range-bound; don\'t chase.'
                       : 'Stretched well above the average price into the dealer ceiling — expect a pullback.';
    var whyz = pinWatch ? '临近到期被钉在大行权价附近——预期区间震荡，勿追。'
                        : '大幅高于均价并冲向做市商天花板——预期回落。';
    return { key:'take_profits', reason_en:why, reason_zh:whyz, muted:false };
  }
  // 2 · Buy now — full continuation setup, not into a ceiling.
  // Quality is a negative filter: only a KNOWN trap (L7===false) blocks; unknown
  // quality (null) must not (trap flags are sparse). Mirrors engine l7 = "is not False".
  if (L1===true && L2===true && L4===true && L7!==false && (L3===true || L5===true) && !intoCeiling) {
    return { key:'act', reason_en:'Reclaimed above the average price on durable volume; structure supports continuation.', reason_zh:'放量收复均价上方；结构支持延续。', muted:false };
  }
  // 3 · Almost ready — base built, trigger not yet fired
  if (L1===true && (L6===true || squeeze) && L7!==false && L2!==true) {
    return { key:'get_ready', reason_en:'Washout base built; waiting for a reclaim above the average price on volume.', reason_zh:'洗盘底部已成；等待放量收复均价上方。', muted:false };
  }
  // 4 · In favour — trending and holding, no fresh washout
  if (L2===true && L6===true && (L3===true || L4===true) && L7!==false && L1!==true) {
    return { key:'in_favour', reason_en:'Trending and holding above the average price; ride it, no fresh entry here.', reason_zh:'趋势中并守住均价上方；持有为宜，此处非新入场点。', muted:false };
  }
  // 5 · Watch — active without structure, or trap-prone
  if ((L3===true || priceUp) && (L1!==true || L7===false)) {
    var wr = L7===false ? 'Moving, but this name has a history of faking breakouts — wait for a clean base.'
                        : 'Moving without a washout base — wait for structure before acting.';
    var wrz = L7===false ? '有异动，但该标的有假突破前科——等待干净底部。'
                         : '异动但无洗盘底部——等待结构再行动。';
    return { key:'watch', reason_en:wr, reason_zh:wrz, muted:false };
  }
  // 6 · Stand aside
  return { key:'stand_aside', reason_en:'Quiet tape, no setup right now.', reason_zh:'盘口平静，当前无布局。', muted:true };
}

// ── Format helpers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function fmtNum(v, dec){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : Number(v).toFixed(dec!=null?dec:2); }
function fmtPct(v){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : (v>=0?'+':'')+Number(v).toFixed(2)+'%'; }
function fmtDollar(v){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : '$'+Number(v).toFixed(2); }
function fmtK(n){ if(n==null||isNaN(n))return '—'; n=Number(n); if(Math.abs(n)>=1e6)return (n/1e6).toFixed(1)+'M'; if(Math.abs(n)>=1e3)return (n/1e3).toFixed(1)+'K'; return n.toFixed(0); }
function esc(s){ return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c];}); }
function lz(en, zh){ return '<span class="l-en">'+en+'</span><span class="l-zh">'+(zh||en)+'</span>'; }

// ── Plain-word metric phrasing ─────────────────────────────────────────────
function volumeWords(rvol, volDur) {
  if (rvol == null) return { en:'—', zh:'—', cls:'gauge-lo', pct:0 };
  var band = rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM ? 'gauge-hi' : (rvol >= 0.8 ? 'gauge-med' : 'gauge-lo');
  var mult = rvol.toFixed(1) + '×';
  var holdEn = volDur != null ? (volDur >= DUR_MIN ? ' · holding' : (volDur >= DUR_MIN*0.7 ? ' · fading' : ' · not holding')) : '';
  var holdZh = volDur != null ? (volDur >= DUR_MIN ? ' · 持稳' : (volDur >= DUR_MIN*0.7 ? ' · 转弱' : ' · 未持稳')) : '';
  return { en: mult + ' normal' + holdEn, zh: mult + '正常' + holdZh, cls: band, pct: Math.min(rvol/3,1)*100 };
}
function rangeWords(rp) {
  if (rp == null) return null;
  return rp > 0.65 ? lz('near day high','接近日高') : (rp < 0.35 ? lz('near day low','接近日低') : lz('mid-range','区间中部'));
}

// ── Fetch: quotes (60s) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quotesInflight = false;
function fetchQuotes() {
  if (quotesInflight) return; quotesInflight = true;
  fetch(snapUrl(), {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).then(function(data){
    quotesInflight = false;
    var q = data.quotes || {};
    Object.keys(q).forEach(function(tk){ quoteState[tk] = q[tk]; });
    render();
  }).catch(function(){ quotesInflight = false; });
}

// ── Fetch: flow pulse (5min) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
var pulseInflight = false;
function fetchPulse() {
  if (pulseInflight) return; pulseInflight = true;
  fetch(pulseUrl(), {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).then(function(data){
    pulseInflight = false;
    (data.tickers || []).forEach(function(t){ pulseState[t.ticker] = t; });
    render();
  }).catch(function(){ pulseInflight = false; });
}

// ── Fetch: live options flow (R2, 2-3min RTH) — FIXED per real schema ──────
// tide_current.json → top_net_impact[] gives a per-root ~net TOTAL premium
//   (net_c+net_p). It carries no call/put lean and never feeds flow.ncp.
// enrich_current.json → per-event list; aggregate per root for badges + tier.
// tickers/<ROOT>.json → per-root cumulative minute series; the ONLY source of the
//   call-only figures — ~net call premium and flow durability.
var flowInflight = false;
function fetchFlow() {
  if (flowInflight) return;
  var tideUrl = r2Url('live_flow/tide_current.json');
  var enrichUrl = r2Url('live_flow/enrich_current.json');
  if (!tideUrl) { updateFlowStamp(null); return; }
  flowInflight = true;
  Promise.all([
    fetch(tideUrl, {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.ok?r.json():null; }).catch(function(){ return null; }),
    fetch(enrichUrl, {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.ok?r.json():null; }).catch(function(){ return null; })
  ]).then(function(res){
    flowInflight = false;
    var tide = res[0], enrich = res[1];
    var asof = null;
    // Per-root ~net TOTAL premium from top_net_impact (confirmed schema).
    if (tide) {
      asof = (tide.meta && tide.meta.asof) || tide.asof || asof;
      (tide.top_net_impact || []).forEach(function(it){
        if (!it || !it.root) return;
        var ex = flowState[it.root] || {};
        // net_prem_soft is net_c+net_p. A positive total can be pure put BUYING, so it
        // states no side — it stays out of `ncp` and only feeds its own labelled row.
        ex.net_all = it.net_prem_soft != null ? it.net_prem_soft : ex.net_all;
        ex.gross = it.gross != null ? it.gross : ex.gross;
        flowState[it.root] = ex;
      });
    }
    // Badges + session tier: aggregate per root from whatever event list enrich exposes.
    if (enrich) {
      // flow.enrich/v1 stamps asof TOP-LEVEL; the legacy meta probe alone read undefined,
      // so the stamp silently fell through to the tide's. Symmetric with the tide line above.
      asof = (enrich.meta && enrich.meta.asof) || enrich.asof || asof;
      var events = enrich.events || enrich.feed || enrich.enriched || [];
      if (!events.length && enrich.tickers) {   // legacy rollup shape, if present
        Object.keys(enrich.tickers).forEach(function(root){
          var te = enrich.tickers[root] || {}, badges = [];
          var bc = te.badge_counts || {};
          ['WHALE','FRESH','Z_OUTLIER','SIZE_VS_OI','REPEAT_HITTER'].forEach(function(b){ if (bc[b]>0) badges.push(b+'×'+bc[b]); });
          var ex = flowState[root] || {}; ex.badges = badges; ex.session_tier = te.session_tier || ex.session_tier; flowState[root] = ex;
        });
      } else {
        var byRoot = {};
        events.forEach(function(ev){
          var root = ev.root; if (!root) return;
          var r = byRoot[root] || { counts:{}, tier:null };
          (ev.badges || []).forEach(function(b){ r.counts[b] = (r.counts[b]||0)+1; });
          if (ev.session_tier) r.tier = bestTier(r.tier, ev.session_tier);
          byRoot[root] = r;
        });
        Object.keys(byRoot).forEach(function(root){
          var r = byRoot[root], badges = [];
          ['WHALE','FRESH','Z_OUTLIER','SIZE_VS_OI','REPEAT_HITTER'].forEach(function(b){ if (r.counts[b]>0) badges.push(b+'×'+r.counts[b]); });
          var ex = flowState[root] || {}; ex.badges = badges; ex.session_tier = r.tier || ex.session_tier; flowState[root] = ex;
        });
      }
    }
    flowAsof = asof; flowRTH = isMarketHours();
    updateFlowStamp(asof);
    // Deepen the board's own names — the per-root payload is the only source of the
    // call-only series the lean and L5 need, and flowState is read for leaders only.
    // top_net_impact is ranked market-wide, so its head is index roots this board never
    // shows; taking the leaders in it (≤20 rows) covers every name that can display a
    // lean and fetches fewer roots than the old blind first-12.
    if (tide && tide.top_net_impact) {
      tide.top_net_impact.forEach(function(it){
        if (it && it.root && LEADERS_BY_TK[it.root]) fetchRootFlow(it.root);
      });
    }
    render();
  }).catch(function(){ flowInflight = false; });
}
function bestTier(a, b) {
  var rank = { below_medium:0, medium:1, high:2, strong:3, elite:4 };
  if (a == null) return b;
  return (rank[b]||0) > (rank[a]||0) ? b : a;
}
function fetchRootFlow(root) {
  var url = r2Url('live_flow/tickers/' + encodeURIComponent(root) + '.json');
  if (!url) return;
  fetch(url, {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.ok?r.json():null; }).then(function(d){
    if (!d) return;
    var mins = d.minutes || [];
    // flow durability = share of 5-min windows whose incremental cumulative NCP > 0
    var dur = null;
    if (mins.length >= 6) {
      var win = 5, p = 0, w = 0;
      for (var i = win; i < mins.length; i += win) {
        var inc = (mins[i].ncp || 0) - (mins[i - win].ncp || 0);
        w++; if (inc > 0) p++;
      }
      if (w > 0) dur = p / w;
    }
    var ex = flowState[root] || {};
    // minutes[] is cumulative, so the last row's ncp IS the session ~net CALL premium —
    // the same series `dur` above is scored on. day.net_soft is ncp+npp, a net total, so
    // it lands in net_all under its own label instead of impersonating call premium.
    var last = mins.length ? mins[mins.length - 1] : null;
    if (last && last.ncp != null) ex.ncp = last.ncp;
    if (d.day && d.day.net_soft != null) ex.net_all = d.day.net_soft;
    if (d.day && d.day.call_share != null) ex.call_share = d.day.call_share;
    if (dur != null) ex.flow_dur = dur;
    flowState[root] = ex;
    render();
  }).catch(function(){});
}
function updateFlowStamp(asof) {
  var stamp = document.getElementById('ift-stamp');
  if (!stamp) return;
  var base = '{{ ift.as_of if ift.as_of else "—" }}';
  var rth = isMarketHours();
  var tapeEn = rth ? ('tape ' + (asof ? 'as of '+asof : 'live')) : ('tape off-hours' + (asof ? ' · last '+asof : ''));
  var tapeZh = rth ? ('资金带 ' + (asof ? '截至 '+asof : '实时')) : ('资金带 非交易时段' + (asof ? ' · 最后 '+asof : ''));
  stamp.innerHTML = lz('Base: '+base+' · '+tapeEn, '基础：'+base+' · '+tapeZh);
}

// ══ compute-once pipeline (shared by hero, spotlight, board) ═══════════════
function computeAll() {
  return leaders.map(function(l){
    var q = quoteState[l.ticker] || null, p = pulseState[l.ticker] || null, f = flowState[l.ticker] || null;
    var conf = computeLegs(l, q, p, f);
    var st = computeStance(l, q, p, f, conf);
    return { l:l, q:q, p:p, f:f, conf:conf, st:st,
             rvol:computeRvol(l,q,p), vwapDelta:computeVwapDelta(q,p), rangePos:computeRangePos(q),
             d:dealerOf(l), meta:STANCE_META[st.key]||STANCE_META.stand_aside };
  });
}
function laneCounts(rows) {
  var c = { act:0, get_ready:0, in_favour:0, take_profits:0, watch:0, stand_aside:0 };
  rows.forEach(function(r){ if (c[r.st.key]!=null) c[r.st.key]++; });
  return c;
}

// ── count-up animation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function animateCount(el, to) {
  if (!el) return;
  var from = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-cv')||'0',10) || 0;
  el.setAttribute('data-cv', String(to));
  if (REDUCED_MOTION || from === to) { el.textContent = String(to); return; }
  var start = null, dur = 550;
  function step(ts){ if (start==null) start=ts; var k=Math.min((ts-start)/dur,1); var e=1-Math.pow(1-k,3);
    el.textContent = String(Math.round(from + (to-from)*e)); if (k<1) requestAnimationFrame(step); }
  requestAnimationFrame(step);
}

// ══ HERO — Session Pulse ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
function buildHero(rows, counts) {
  var phase = sessionPhase();
  var live = phase === 'live';
  var actionable = counts.act + counts.get_ready;

  // session pill
  var pill = document.getElementById('sess-pill'), sstate = document.getElementById('sess-state');
  var pmap = { live:['sess-live', lz('Market open','开盘中')], pre:['sess-pre', lz('Pre-market','盘前')],
    post:['sess-post', lz('After hours','盘后')], closed:['sess-closed', lz('Market closed','已收盘')] };
  if (pill) { pill.className = 'sess-pill '+pmap[phase][0]; }
  if (sstate) sstate.innerHTML = pmap[phase][1];

  // thesis + sub + tint
  var thesis, sub, tint, tape;
  if (live && counts.act > 0) {
    var n = counts.act;
    thesis = lz(n+' leader'+(n>1?'s are':' is')+' being bought back on real volume.', n+' 只领涨股正被放量重新买入。');
    sub = lz('Each reclaimed a washout on durable volume — the continuation setups are live.',
             '各标的在放量中收复了洗盘底部——延续布局已激活。');
    tint = 'thesis-green'; tape = 'tape-green';
  } else if (live && counts.get_ready > 0) {
    var g = counts.get_ready;
    thesis = lz('Bases are building — '+g+' name'+(g>1?'s':'')+' almost ready, none triggered yet.', g+' 只标的底部渐成、即将就绪，暂无触发。');
    sub = lz('Bases are in place, waiting for a reclaim on volume — watch, don\'t pre-empt.',
             '底部已就位，等待放量收复——观察为宜，勿抢跑。');
    tint = 'thesis-blue'; tape = 'tape-blue';
  } else if (live && counts.take_profits > 0) {
    thesis = lz('Leaders are stretched — protect gains, don\'t chase.', '领涨股已拉伸——保护利润，勿追高。');
    sub = lz('The movers are stretched or pinned into a ceiling — nothing fresh to start here.',
             '活跃标的已拉伸或顶到天花板——此处无新入场。');
    tint = 'thesis-amber'; tape = 'tape-amber';
  } else if (live) {
    thesis = lz('Quiet tape — nothing set up to chase right now.', '资金带平静——当前无可追布局。');
    sub = lz('No leader is being bought back from a washout yet — the board updates itself.',
             '暂无领涨股在洗盘后被买回——看板将自动更新。');
    tint = 'thesis-slate'; tape = 'tape-quiet';
  } else {
    // off-hours skeleton
    var readyN = counts.get_ready;
    if (readyN > 0) {
      thesis = lz('Market\'s '+(phase==='pre'?'not open yet':'closed')+' — '+readyN+' name'+(readyN>1?'s have':' has')+' a base ready for the open.', '市场'+(phase==='pre'?'尚未开盘':'已收盘')+'——'+readyN+' 只标的底部已就位、静候开盘。');
      sub = lz('Built a washout base overnight — watch for a reclaim on volume at the open.',
               '隔夜筑成洗盘底部——开盘后留意放量收复。');
      tint = 'thesis-blue'; tape = 'tape-blue';
    } else {
      thesis = lz('Market\'s '+(phase==='pre'?'not open yet':'closed')+' — nothing set up for the open.', '市场'+(phase==='pre'?'尚未开盘':'已收盘')+'——暂无为开盘准备的布局。');
      sub = lz('No washout base is ready across the watchlist — check back when the tape runs.',
               '观察名单中暂无就绪底部——资金带运行时再来。');
      tint = 'thesis-slate'; tape = 'tape-quiet';
    }
  }
  var thEl = document.getElementById('hero-thesis');
  if (thEl) { thEl.className = 'hero-thesis '+tint; thEl.innerHTML = thesis; }
  var subEl = document.getElementById('hero-sub'); if (subEl) subEl.innerHTML = sub;
  // toggle only the tape-* tint class — never clobber classes theme.js owns on <body>
  document.body.classList.remove('tape-green','tape-blue','tape-amber','tape-quiet');
  document.body.classList.add(tape);

  // score number
  var num = document.getElementById('hs-count');
  var scoreC = actionable>0 ? (counts.act>0 ? 'var(--ok,#3da564)' : 'var(--info,#5b9bf0)')
             : (live && counts.take_profits>0 ? 'var(--orange,#e08b45)' : 'var(--muted)');
  if (num) { num.style.setProperty('--score-c', scoreC); animateCount(num, actionable); }

  // composition ribbon + legend — segment/dot color comes from the .lane-* class
  // (CSS var --lane), so in_favour auto-flips red in zh with no re-render. No title=
  // tooltip (would jam EN+ZH into an OS tooltip that ignores the lang toggle); the
  // legend below is the key.
  var order = ['act','get_ready','in_favour','take_profits','watch','stand_aside'];
  var seg = '', leg = '';
  order.forEach(function(k){
    var v = counts[k]||0; if (v<=0) return;
    var meta = STANCE_META[k], cls = 'lane-'+laneSuffix(k);
    seg += '<div class="comp-seg '+cls+'" style="flex:'+v+' '+v+' 0%"></div>';
    leg += '<span class="cl-item"><span class="cl-dot '+cls+'"></span>'+lz(meta.en,meta.zh)+' '+v+'</span>';
  });
  var comp = document.getElementById('comp-bar'); if (comp) comp.innerHTML = seg || '<div class="comp-seg" style="flex:1;background:var(--muted);opacity:.3"></div>';
  var legEl = document.getElementById('comp-legend'); if (legEl) legEl.innerHTML = leg;

  // strongest tape / most-ready context
  var strong = document.getElementById('ctx-strong');
  if (strong) {
    if (live) {
      var pool = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.rvol != null; }).sort(function(a,b){ return (b.rvol||0)-(a.rvol||0); });
      if (pool.length && pool[0].rvol >= 0.8) {
        var top = pool[0]; var vw = volumeWords(top.rvol, top.p?top.p.vol_durability:null);
        strong.innerHTML = lz('Strongest tape: <b>'+esc(top.l.ticker)+'</b> · '+vw.en, '最强资金带：<b>'+esc(top.l.ticker)+'</b> · '+vw.zh);
      } else strong.innerHTML = lz('No name is trading at unusual volume yet.','暂无标的出现异常放量。');
    } else {
      var ready = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.st.key==='get_ready'; }).sort(function(a,b){ return (b.conf.K||0)-(a.conf.K||0); });
      if (ready.length) strong.innerHTML = lz('Most ready for the open: <b>'+esc(ready[0].l.ticker)+'</b> · base built', '最接近开盘就绪：<b>'+esc(ready[0].l.ticker)+'</b> · 底部已成');
      else strong.innerHTML = lz('No base is set up across the watchlist right now.','观察名单中暂无就绪布局。');
    }
  }
  var watchEl = document.getElementById('ctx-watch');
  if (watchEl) {
    if (live && counts.take_profits>0) watchEl.innerHTML = lz(counts.take_profits+' name'+(counts.take_profits>1?'s are':' is')+' stretched into resistance — take profits, don\'t chase.', counts.take_profits+' 只标的冲高至阻力——获利了结，勿追。');
    else if (counts.watch>0) watchEl.innerHTML = lz(counts.watch+' name'+(counts.watch>1?'s are':' is')+' moving without a base — watch, don\'t chase.', counts.watch+' 只标的无底部异动——观望，勿追。');
    else watchEl.innerHTML = lz('The board below carries every name and the reasoning behind each call.','下方看板列出每只标的及其结论依据。');
  }
}
function laneSuffix(k){ return { act:'act',get_ready:'ready',in_favour:'fav',take_profits:'profit',watch:'watch',stand_aside:'aside' }[k]||'aside'; }

// ══ SPOTLIGHT — Look here first ════════════════════════════════════════════
function buildSpotlight(rows, counts) {
  var grid = document.getElementById('spot-grid'), note = document.getElementById('spot-note');
  if (!grid) return;
  var live = sessionPhase() === 'live';
  var pick = [];
  // priority: act (rvol desc) → get_ready (K desc) → live: take_profits (protect, 1)
  var acts = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.st.key==='act'; }).sort(function(a,b){ return (b.rvol||0)-(a.rvol||0); });
  var readies = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.st.key==='get_ready'; }).sort(function(a,b){ return (b.conf.K||0)-(a.conf.K||0) || (b.rvol||0)-(a.rvol||0); });
  pick = acts.concat(readies).slice(0,3);
  var noteTxt = live ? lz('the strongest setups on the tape right now','当前资金带上最强的布局')
                     : lz('bases ready for the open','静候开盘的就绪底部');
  if (!pick.length && live && counts.take_profits>0) {
    pick = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.st.key==='take_profits'; }).slice(0,2);
    noteTxt = lz('stretched — protect gains, don\'t chase','已拉伸——保护利润，勿追');
  }
  if (note) note.innerHTML = noteTxt;

  if (!pick.length) {
    grid.innerHTML = '<div class="spot-empty">'+
      (live ? lz('<b>No fresh setups right now.</b> No leader is being bought back out of a washout — the board below is on watch and will surface names here as they set up.',
                 '<b>当前无新布局。</b> 暂无领涨股在洗盘后被重新买入——下方看板处于观察状态，一旦成形便会在此呈现。')
            : lz('<b>Nothing set up for the open yet.</b> When a leader builds a washout base, it will appear here first.',
                 '<b>暂无为开盘准备的布局。</b> 一旦有领涨股筑成洗盘底部，将优先在此显示。'))
      +'</div>';
    return;
  }
  grid.innerHTML = pick.map(function(r, i){ return spotCard(r, i); }).join('');
}
function spotCard(r, i) {
  var l = r.l, meta = r.meta, st = r.st, d = r.d, q = r.q, p = r.p, f = r.f;
  var vw = volumeWords(r.rvol, p ? p.vol_durability : null);
  var vwapDelta = r.vwapDelta;
  var vwapV = vwapDelta!=null ? '<span class="'+(vwapDelta>=0?'pos':'neg')+'">'+fmtPct(vwapDelta)+'</span>' : '<span class="muted">—</span>';
  var leanV;
  if (f && f.ncp != null) leanV = lz((f.ncp>0?'~call buying':'~call selling'), (f.ncp>0?'~买入看涨':'~卖出看涨'))+'<span class="soft-tag">~soft</span>';
  else if (f && f.net_all != null) leanV = '<span class="muted">'+lz('side unknown','方向未知')+'</span>';
  else leanV = '<span class="muted">'+lz('quiet','平静')+'</span>';
  var entry = l.entry_signal || {};
  var stopV = entry.stop!=null ? fmtDollar(entry.stop) : (d && d.put_wall!=null ? '~$'+fmtNum(d.put_wall,0) : (q && q.lo!=null ? fmtDollar(q.lo) : '—'));
  var breathe = (i===0 && st.key==='act' && !REDUCED_MOTION) ? ' breathe' : '';
  var bk = (l.baskets||[]).slice(0,1).map(prettyBasket).join('');
  return '<article class="spot-card '+meta.lane+breathe+'">'
    + '<div class="spot-hd">'
    +   '<div><a class="spot-tk" href="stock.html#'+l.ticker+'">'+esc(l.ticker)+'</a>'+(bk?'<div class="spot-tk-sub">'+esc(bk)+'</div>':'')+'</div>'
    +   '<span class="stance-pill '+meta.lane+'"><span class="sp-dot"></span>'+lz(meta.en,meta.zh)+'</span>'
    + '</div>'
    + '<p class="spot-reason">'+lz(st.reason_en, st.reason_zh)+'</p>'
    + '<div class="spot-metrics">'
    +   '<div><span class="sm-k">'+lz('Volume','成交量')+'</span><span class="sm-v">'+lz(vw.en,vw.zh)+'</span></div>'
    +   '<div><span class="sm-k">'+lz('Vs avg price','对均价')+'</span><span class="sm-v">'+vwapV+'</span></div>'
    +   '<div><span class="sm-k">'+lz('Options lean','期权倾向')+'</span><span class="sm-v">'+leanV+'</span></div>'
    +   '<div><span class="sm-k">'+lz('Stop ref','止损参考')+'</span><span class="sm-v">'+stopV+'</span></div>'
    + '</div>'
    + '</article>';
}

// ── Build one leader row (glance) + detail row (Tier-2) ───────────────────
function buildRow(row) {
  var leader = row.l, quote = row.q, pulse = row.p, flow = row.f, conf = row.conf;
  var tk = leader.ticker;
  var stance = row.st, meta = row.meta, rvol = row.rvol, rangePos = row.rangePos, vwapDelta = row.vwapDelta, d = row.d;

  var bk = (leader.baskets || []).slice(0,1).map(function(b){ return prettyBasket(b); }).join('');
  var nameCell = '<td><a class="tk-link" href="stock.html#'+tk+'">'+tk+'</a>'
    + (bk ? '<div class="tk-baskets">'+esc(bk)+'</div>' : '') + '</td>';

  var pill = '<span class="stance-pill '+meta.lane+'"><span class="sp-dot"></span>' + lz(meta.en, meta.zh) + '</span>';
  var reason = '<div class="stance-reason '+(stance.muted?'muted':'')+'">'+lz(stance.reason_en, stance.reason_zh)+'</div>';
  var stanceCell = '<td class="stance-cell '+meta.lane+'">'+pill+reason+'</td>';

  var px = quote && quote.price != null ? fmtDollar(quote.price) : '—';
  var chg = quote && quote.changePct != null ? fmtPct(quote.changePct) : '';
  var chgCls = quote && quote.changePct != null ? (quote.changePct>=0?'pos':'neg') : '';
  var rw = rangeWords(rangePos);
  var priceCell = '<td class="price-cell hide-narrow"><span class="nb-px" data-sym="'+tk+'" data-mkt="us">'+px+'</span>'
    + '<span class="pct-chg '+chgCls+'">'+chg+'</span>'
    + (rw ? '<div class="metric-sub">'+rw+'</div>' : '') + '</td>';

  var volDur = pulse ? pulse.vol_durability : null;
  var vw = volumeWords(rvol, volDur);
  var volCell = '<td>'
    + '<div class="gauge-wrap"><div class="gauge-bar"><div class="gauge-fill '+vw.cls+'" style="width:'+vw.pct.toFixed(0)+'%"></div></div>'
    + '<span class="metric-lead">'+lz(vw.en, vw.zh)+'</span></div>'
    + (pulse && pulse.higher_lows != null && pulse.higher_lows > 0 ? '<div class="metric-sub">'+lz('higher lows ×'+pulse.higher_lows, '更高低点 ×'+pulse.higher_lows)+'</div>' : '')
    + '</td>';

  var vwapWord = vwapDelta != null ? (vwapDelta > 0 ? lz('above avg price','高于均价') : lz('below avg price','低于均价')) : lz('—','—');
  var vwapCls = vwapDelta != null ? (vwapDelta>0?'pos':'neg') : 'muted';
  var lean = '';
  if (flow && flow.ncp != null) {
    var lp = flow.ncp > 0;
    lean = '<div class="metric-sub">'+lz((lp?'~call buying':'~call selling'), (lp?'~买入看涨':'~卖出看涨'))+'<span class="soft-tag">~soft</span></div>';
  } else if (flow && flow.net_all != null) {
    // Premium moved, but only the net total is in — no side to state yet.
    lean = '<div class="metric-sub muted">'+lz('side unknown','方向未知')+'</div>';
  } else if (flowRTH) {
    lean = '<div class="metric-sub muted">'+lz('quiet tape','资金带平静')+'</div>';
  } else {
    lean = '<div class="metric-sub muted">'+lz('off-hours','非交易时段')+'</div>';
  }
  var badges = flow && flow.badges ? flow.badges : [];
  var badgeHtml = badges.length ? '<div class="chip-row">'+badges.slice(0,3).map(function(b){ return '<span class="badge badge-blue">'+esc(b)+'</span>'; }).join('')+'</div>' : '';
  var tapeCell = '<td class="hide-narrow"><span class="metric-lead '+vwapCls+'">'+vwapWord+'</span>'+lean+badgeHtml+'</td>';

  var dealerCell = '<td class="dealer-cell hide-narrow">'+dealerCompact(d, quote)+'</td>';
  var expCell = '<td class="col-expand"><span class="expander" data-exp="'+tk+'">'+(openRows[tk]?'▾':'▸')+'</span></td>';

  var tr = '<tr class="lead-row" data-ticker="'+tk+'" data-stance="'+stance.key+'"'
    + ' data-rvol="'+(rvol||0)+'" data-k="'+conf.K+'" data-last="'+((quote&&quote.price)||0)+'"'
    + ' data-stance-order="'+meta.order+'" data-baskets="'+esc((leader.baskets||[]).join(' ')||'all')+'">'
    + nameCell + stanceCell + priceCell + volCell + tapeCell + dealerCell + expCell + '</tr>';

  var detail = '<tr class="detail-row'+(openRows[tk]?' open':'')+'" data-detail="'+tk+'"><td colspan="7"><div class="detail-inner">'
    + detailContent(leader, quote, pulse, flow, conf, d) + '</div></td></tr>';

  return tr + detail;
}

function prettyBasket(b) {
  var m = { mag7:'Mag7', ai_infra:'AI Infra', ai_software:'AI Software', ai_semiconductors:'AI Semis',
    semicap_equipment:'Semicap', reshoring:'Reshoring', defense:'Defense', power_grid:'Power Grid' };
  return m[b] || b;
}

// ── Dealer compact (ceiling / floor / move / hole) ─────────────────────────
function dealerCompact(d, quote) {
  if (!d) return '<span class="dealer-na">'+lz('no chain','无期权链')+'</span>';
  var out = [];
  var regime = d.regime === 'long' ? 'rd-long' : (d.regime === 'short' ? 'rd-short' : 'rd-neutral');
  var regimeWord = d.regime === 'long' ? lz('pins / mean-reverts','磁吸/均值回归') : (d.regime === 'short' ? lz('trends / amplifies','趋势/放大') : lz('neutral','中性'));
  out.push('<div class="dealer-line"><span class="regime-dot '+regime+'"></span>'+regimeWord+'</div>');
  if (d.call_wall != null) {
    var hard = d.call_wall_hard ? lz(' (hard)',' (硬)') : '';
    out.push('<div class="dealer-line">'+lz('ceiling','天花板')+' ~$'+fmtNum(d.call_wall,0)+hard+'</div>');
  }
  if (d.put_wall != null) out.push('<div class="dealer-line">'+lz('floor','地板')+' ~$'+fmtNum(d.put_wall,0)+'</div>');
  if (d.expected_move_daily_pct != null) out.push('<div class="dealer-line muted">'+lz('~'+fmtNum(d.expected_move_daily_pct,1)+'% move today','~今日约'+fmtNum(d.expected_move_daily_pct,1)+'%波动')+'</div>');
  if (d.vol_hole_state && d.vol_hole_state !== 'NONE') {
    var vh = { IN_HOLE: lz('pinned between walls','被夹在墙位间'), COILED_UP: lz('coiled — upward','蓄势向上'),
      COILED_DOWN: lz('coiled — downward','蓄势向下'), EXPANSION: lz('breaking out','正在扩张') }[d.vol_hole_state];
    if (vh) out.push('<div class="dealer-line" style="color:var(--orange,#e08b45)">'+vh+'</div>');
  }
  return out.join('');
}

// ── Detail (Tier-2 full depth) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
function detailContent(leader, quote, pulse, flow, conf, d) {
  var blocks = [];
  var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote, pulse), vwapDelta = computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse);
  var tapeDl = [];
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Relative volume','相对成交量'), rvol!=null ? fmtNum(rvol,2)+'×' : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Vol durability','量能持续'), pulse&&pulse.vol_durability!=null ? (pulse.vol_durability*100).toFixed(0)+'%' : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Session VWAP','当日VWAP'), pulse&&pulse.vwap!=null ? fmtDollar(pulse.vwap) : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Price vs VWAP','价格对VWAP'), vwapDelta!=null ? fmtPct(vwapDelta) : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Higher lows','更高低点'), pulse&&pulse.higher_lows!=null ? String(pulse.higher_lows) : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('~Net call premium','~净看涨权利金'), flow&&flow.ncp!=null ? '~'+(flow.ncp>=0?'+':'')+fmtK(flow.ncp) : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('~Net premium (calls+puts)','~净权利金（看涨+看跌）'), flow&&flow.net_all!=null ? '~'+(flow.net_all>=0?'+':'')+fmtK(flow.net_all) : '—'));
  tapeDl.push(dlRow(lz('Flow durability','资金持续'), flow&&flow.flow_dur!=null ? (flow.flow_dur*100).toFixed(0)+'%' : '—'));
  blocks.push(detailBlock(lz('Tape &amp; volume','盘口与量能'), '<div class="dl">'+tapeDl.join('')+'</div>'));

  var names = [
    lz('Recent washout','近期洗盘'), lz('Reclaimed above VWAP','收复VWAP上方'), lz('Volume elevated','放量'),
    lz('Volume holding','量能持稳'), lz('~Options leaning in','~期权偏多'), lz('Trend turning up','趋势转强'), lz('Clean leader (no trap)','干净领涨（无陷阱）')
  ];
  var checks = conf.legs.map(function(on, i){
    var cls = on===true ? 'on' : (on===false ? 'off' : 'na');
    var ic = on===true ? '✓' : (on===false ? '✗' : '·');
    return '<span class="check '+cls+'"><span class="ic">'+ic+'</span>'+names[i]+'</span>';
  }).join('');
  blocks.push(detailBlock(lz(conf.K+' of 7 checks aligned','7项中'+conf.K+'项一致'), '<div class="checks">'+checks+'</div>'));

  blocks.push(detailBlock(lz('Dealer map (options chains)','做市商地图（期权链）'), dealerFull(d, quote)));

  var entry = leader.entry_signal || {};
  var lvl = [];
  if (entry.stop != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Stop (nightly)','止损（夜间）'), '<span class="neg">'+fmtDollar(entry.stop)+'</span>'));
  if (pulse && pulse.vwap != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('VWAP','均价'), fmtDollar(pulse.vwap)));
  if (quote && quote.lo != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Session low','日内低点'), fmtDollar(quote.lo)));
  if (d && d.call_wall != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Dealer ceiling','做市商天花板'), '~$'+fmtNum(d.call_wall,0)));
  if (d && d.put_wall != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Dealer floor','做市商地板'), '~$'+fmtNum(d.put_wall,0)));
  var atr = entry.atr_pct != null ? entry.atr_pct.toFixed(2)+'%' : (leader.atr14_pct!=null ? (leader.atr14_pct*100).toFixed(2)+'%' : null);
  if (atr) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Daily range (ATR)','日均波幅(ATR)'), atr));
  if (entry.buy_zone && entry.buy_zone.low != null) lvl.push(dlRow(lz('Buy zone','买入区间'), fmtDollar(entry.buy_zone.low)+'–'+fmtDollar(entry.buy_zone.high)));
  blocks.push(detailBlock(lz('Reference levels','参考价位'), '<div class="dl">'+lvl.join('')+'</div>'
    + '<div class="receipt">'+lz('Reference only — not trade advice.','仅供参考——不构成交易建议。')+'</div>'));

  return blocks.join('');
}
function detailBlock(title, inner){ return '<div class="detail-block"><h4>'+title+'</h4>'+inner+'</div>'; }
function dlRow(k, v){ return '<div class="k">'+k+'</div><div class="v">'+v+'</div>'; }

// ── Dealer full panel (ported from Terminal renderGex — display-only) ──────
function dealerFull(d, quote) {
  if (!d) return '<div class="dealer-na">'+lz('No options chain for this name.','该标的无期权链。')+'</div>';
  var dl = [];
  var regimeWord = d.regime === 'long' ? lz('Long gamma · pins / mean-reverts','多头Gamma · 磁吸/均值回归')
    : (d.regime === 'short' ? lz('Short gamma · trends / amplifies','空头Gamma · 趋势/放大') : lz('Neutral','中性'));
  dl.push(dlRow(lz('Dealer regime','做市商体制'), regimeWord));
  if (d.gamma_flip != null) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Regime line','体制分界'), fmtNum(d.gamma_flip,2) + (d.dist_to_flip_pct!=null?' <span class="muted">('+(d.dist_to_flip_pct>=0?'+':'')+fmtNum(d.dist_to_flip_pct,1)+'%)</span>':'')));
  if (d.call_wall != null) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Ceiling (call wall)','天花板（看涨墙）'), '~$'+fmtNum(d.call_wall,0) + (d.call_wall_band?' <span class="muted">'+esc(d.call_wall_band)+(d.call_wall_hard?', hard':'')+'</span>':'')));
  if (d.put_wall != null) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Floor (put wall)','地板（看跌墙）'), '~$'+fmtNum(d.put_wall,0) + (d.put_wall_band?' <span class="muted">'+esc(d.put_wall_band)+'</span>':'')));
  if (d.max_pain != null) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Max pain','最大痛点'), '~$'+fmtNum(d.max_pain,0)));
  if (d.expected_move_daily_pct != null) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Expected move (day)','预期波动（日）'), '±'+fmtNum(d.expected_move_daily_pct,1)+'%'));
  if (d.iv_rank_band) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Implied vol','隐含波动'), ivBandWord(d.iv_rank_band) + (d.iv30!=null?' <span class="muted">('+fmtNum(d.iv30,1)+')</span>':'')));
  if (d.skew_tone) dl.push(dlRow(lz('Skew tone','偏斜'), skewWord(d.skew_tone)));
  dl.push(dlRow(lz('Evidence','数据质量'), evidenceWord(d._eq)));

  var posture = d.regime === 'long'
    ? lz('Long gamma — dealers dampen moves, so price tends to pin / mean-revert toward the nearby levels; fading extremes beats chasing breakouts, and tighter stops are reasonable.', '多头Gamma —— 做市商抑制波动，价格倾向于在邻近价位附近被钉住/均值回归；逢极端回落优于追突破，止损可更紧。')
    : (d.regime === 'short'
    ? lz('Short gamma — dealers chase the move, so swings amplify and trend; breakouts can follow through but whipsaws are larger, so give it wider stops.', '空头Gamma —— 做市商追随价格，波动被放大并趋势化；突破可延续但假动作更大，止损宜更宽。')
    : '');
  var pin = '';
  if (d.opex_days != null && d.opex_days <= 7 && d.regime === 'long' && quote && quote.price && d.magnet_up != null && Math.abs(quote.price - d.magnet_up)/quote.price < 0.015) {
    pin = '<div class="receipt" style="color:var(--orange,#e08b45)">📌 '+lz('Pinned into expiry ('+d.opex_days+'d) near '+fmtNum(d.magnet_up,2)+' — expect range-compression; a breakout here may just be a pin.', '临近到期（'+d.opex_days+'天）且贴近 '+fmtNum(d.magnet_up,2)+' —— 预期区间收敛；此处突破可能只是钉住。')+'</div>';
  }
  var caveat = '<div class="receipt">'+lz('Daily options chains — a levels + timing map. Context for stops, never a direction call. Single-name regime is a near-constant product trait, not a live signal.', '每日期权链——价位与择时地图。仅作止损背景，非方向判断。单只标的体制为产品近乎恒定的属性，非实时信号。')+'</div>';
  return '<div class="dl">'+dl.join('')+'</div>'+(posture?'<p class="posture">'+posture+'</p>':'')+pin+caveat;
}
function ivBandWord(b){ var m={ very_cheap:lz('very cheap','很便宜'), cheap:lz('cheap','便宜'), normal:lz('normal','正常'), elevated:lz('elevated','偏高'), rich:lz('rich','昂贵') }; return m[b]||esc(b); }
function skewWord(t){ var m={ fear:lz('downside fear bid','下行恐慌买盘'), greed:lz('upside chased','上行追捧'), balanced:lz('balanced','均衡') }; return m[t]||esc(t); }
function evidenceWord(q){ var m={ full:lz('full','完整'), partial:lz('partial','部分'), thin:lz('thin','稀薄'), stale:lz('stale','过时') }; return m[q]||lz('—','—'); }

// ── Stance counts (strip) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
function updateStanceCounts(counts) {
  Object.keys(counts).forEach(function(k){ var el = document.querySelector('[data-count="'+k+'"]'); if (el) animateCount(el, counts[k]); });
}

// ── Sort / filter / group ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
var COL_ATTR = { ticker:'data-ticker', last:'data-last', rvol:'data-rvol', stance:'data-stance-order', dealer:'data-rvol' };
function sortRows(rows) {
  var attr = COL_ATTR[sortCol] || 'data-rvol';
  rows.sort(function(a,b){
    if (groupByStance) {
      var ao = Number(a.getAttribute('data-stance-order')||9), bo = Number(b.getAttribute('data-stance-order')||9);
      if (ao !== bo) return ao - bo;   // group order fixed; sort within by measured
      var ar = Number(a.getAttribute('data-rvol')||0), br = Number(b.getAttribute('data-rvol')||0);
      return br - ar;
    }
    var av = a.getAttribute(attr)||'0', bv = b.getAttribute(attr)||'0';
    var an = isNaN(av)?av:Number(av), bn = isNaN(bv)?bv:Number(bv);
    if (an < bn) return sortDir; if (an > bn) return -sortDir; return 0;
  });
  return rows;
}
function applyView() {
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) return;
  [].slice.call(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr.group-head')).forEach(function(g){ g.parentNode.removeChild(g); });
  var leadRows = [].slice.call(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr.lead-row'));
  var detailByTk = {};
  [].slice.call(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr.detail-row')).forEach(function(d){ detailByTk[d.getAttribute('data-detail')] = d; });
  sortRows(leadRows);
  var visible = 0, curGroup = null, frag = document.createDocumentFragment();
  leadRows.forEach(function(r){
    var tk = r.getAttribute('data-ticker'), k = Number(r.getAttribute('data-k')||0);
    var st = r.getAttribute('data-stance'), baskets = r.getAttribute('data-baskets')||'all';
    var show = true;
    if (activeBasket !== 'all' && baskets.indexOf(activeBasket) < 0 && baskets !== 'all') show = false;
    if (activeStance !== 'all' && st !== activeStance) show = false;
    if (searchQ && tk.indexOf(searchQ.toUpperCase()) < 0) show = false;
    if (!show) { r.style.display='none'; if (detailByTk[tk]) detailByTk[tk].style.display='none'; return; }
    if (groupByStance && st !== curGroup) {
      curGroup = st;
      var meta = STANCE_META[st] || STANCE_META.stand_aside;
      var gh = document.createElement('tr'); gh.className='group-head '+meta.lane;
      gh.innerHTML = '<td colspan="7"><span class="gh-dot"></span>'+lz(meta.en, meta.zh)+'</td>';
      frag.appendChild(gh);
    }
    r.style.display=''; frag.appendChild(r);
    if (detailByTk[tk]) { detailByTk[tk].style.display=''; frag.appendChild(detailByTk[tk]); }
    visible++;
  });
  tbody.appendChild(frag);
  var lbl = document.getElementById('count-label');
  if (lbl) lbl.innerHTML = lz(visible+' of '+leadRows.length+' leaders shown', '显示 '+visible+' / '+leadRows.length+' 只');
  var ths = document.querySelectorAll('table.leaders th[data-col]');
  ths.forEach(function(th){ th.classList.remove('sort-asc','sort-desc'); if (!groupByStance && th.getAttribute('data-col')===sortCol) th.classList.add(sortDir<0?'sort-desc':'sort-asc'); });
}

// ── Full render ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var _rendering = false;
function render() {
  if (_rendering) return; _rendering = true;
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) { _rendering = false; return; }
  var computed = computeAll();
  var counts = laneCounts(computed);

  // hero + spotlight from the shared compute
  buildHero(computed, counts);
  buildSpotlight(computed, counts);
  updateStanceCounts(counts);

  // board
  var html = '';
  computed.forEach(function(row){
    var d = row.d;
    if (d) { d._tk = row.l.ticker; d._eq = (row.l.options_entry||{}).evidence_quality; }
    html += buildRow(row);
  });
  tbody.innerHTML = html || '<tr class="loading-row"><td colspan="7">'+lz('No data yet','暂无数据')+'</td></tr>';
  applyView();
  if (window.__mmLang) window.__mmLang();
  _rendering = false;
}

// ── Events ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('.playbook-hd').forEach(function(hd){
  hd.addEventListener('click', function(){ hd.parentElement.classList.toggle('open'); });
});
document.querySelectorAll('table.leaders th[data-col]').forEach(function(th){
  th.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var col = th.getAttribute('data-col');
    if (col === 'expand' || col === 'tape' || col === 'dealer') return;
    if (groupByStance) { groupByStance = false; setGroupToggle(false); }
    if (col === sortCol) sortDir = -sortDir; else { sortCol = col; sortDir = -1; }
    applyView();
    var sl = document.getElementById('sort-label'); if (sl) sl.textContent = '';
  });
});
document.querySelectorAll('.chip[data-basket]').forEach(function(chip){
  chip.addEventListener('click', function(){
    document.querySelectorAll('.chip[data-basket]').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('active'); });
    chip.classList.add('active'); activeBasket = chip.getAttribute('data-basket'); applyView();
  });
});
document.querySelectorAll('.stance-card[data-stance]').forEach(function(card){
  card.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var s = card.getAttribute('data-stance');
    if (activeStance === s) { activeStance = 'all'; card.classList.remove('active'); }
    else { document.querySelectorAll('.stance-card').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('active'); }); activeStance = s; card.classList.add('active'); }
    // scroll the board into view when a lane is picked
    if (activeStance !== 'all') { var bd = document.getElementById('leaders-table'); if (bd && bd.scrollIntoView) bd.scrollIntoView({behavior: REDUCED_MOTION?'auto':'smooth', block:'start'}); }
    applyView();
  });
});
var groupToggle = document.getElementById('group-toggle');
function setGroupToggle(on){ groupByStance = on; if (groupToggle) groupToggle.classList.toggle('active', on); }
if (groupToggle) groupToggle.addEventListener('click', function(){ setGroupToggle(!groupByStance); applyView(); });
document.getElementById('leaders-body').addEventListener('click', function(e){
  var exp = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.expander') : null;
  if (!exp) return;
  var tk = exp.getAttribute('data-exp');
  openRows[tk] = !openRows[tk];
  exp.textContent = openRows[tk] ? '▾' : '▸';
  var dr = document.querySelector('tr.detail-row[data-detail="'+tk+'"]');
  if (dr) dr.classList.toggle('open', openRows[tk]);
});
var searchEl = document.getElementById('ift-search');
if (searchEl) {
  searchEl.addEventListener('input', function(){ searchQ = searchEl.value.trim(); applyView(); });
  (function(){ var en=searchEl.placeholder, zh=searchEl.getAttribute('data-ph-zh')||en;
    function setPh(){ searchEl.placeholder = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang')==='zh'?zh:en; }
    setPh(); document.addEventListener('langchange', setPh); })();
}
// No langchange→render needed: static bilingual spans swap via CSS (l-en/l-zh), and the
// composition ribbon's in_favour segment flips red in zh through the .lane-fav CSS var.

// ── Polling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function startPolling() {
  fetchQuotes(); fetchPulse(); fetchFlow(); updateFlowStamp(null);
  setInterval(fetchQuotes, 60*1000);
  setInterval(fetchPulse, 5*60*1000);
  setInterval(function(){ if (isMarketHours()) fetchFlow(); }, 3*60*1000);
}
setGroupToggle(true);
render();
if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', startPolling);
else startPolling();

})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
